        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The titles of clinical lecturer, clinical instructor, clinical assistant professor, clinical associate professor or clinical professor shall be used for unit members who are also practitioners in health care delivery professions or in other professions to which such titles would be applicable.",
